{"3739340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The White Sea", "steam_appid": 3739340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/a6bd22fbf22bff0f6cca5e480a3be27d.avif?t=1771532003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras_big/a6bd22fbf22bff0f6cca5e480a3be27d.avif?t=1771532003 width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;What if your worst memories were part of a show… and you were the star?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The White Sea</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where nothing is what it seems. Set in an alternate version of the United States during the 1970s and 1980s, you play as <strong>Allison Graham</strong>, a journalist sent to investigate the mysterious abandoned town of White Sea, Montana.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officially, the area was shut down after a series of disappearances in 1998. But Allison soon realizes her arrival was no coincidence: she has been selected as part of a twisted show designed to push her beyond her mental and emotional limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with distorted visions, psychological trials, and manipulated memories, she must find a way to escape… or become lost forever in a performance where every decision is watched, judged, and controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immersive first-person psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and limited mechanics: limit resources, each flash reveals more than just walls... it reveals truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented, reactive narrative: uncover what’s real and what’s part of the show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal journey into the past and mental manipulation, with emotional and symbolic weight.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/5aea0ee64bde35ccbfdbd3726b458b54.avif?t=1771532003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras_big/5aea0ee64bde35ccbfdbd3726b458b54.avif?t=1771532003 width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.poster.avif?t=1771532003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.webm?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.mp4?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/b49144214714589bcc90b130244c6ee5.poster.avif?t=1771532003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/b49144214714589bcc90b130244c6ee5.webm?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/b49144214714589bcc90b130244c6ee5.mp4?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.