 judged, and controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully immersive first-person psychological horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration and limited mechanics: limit resources, each flash reveals more than just walls... it reveals truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented, reactive narrative: uncover what’s real and what’s part of the show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A personal journey into the past and mental manipulation, with emotional and symbolic weight.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes:<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/5aea0ee64bde35ccbfdbd3726b458b54.avif?t=1771532003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras_big/5aea0ee64bde35ccbfdbd3726b458b54.avif?t=1771532003 width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.poster.avif?t=1771532003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.webm?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/21b33407b679f881707cbf9d1ad7a56f.mp4?t=1771532003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739340/extras/b49144214714589bcc90b130244c6ee5.poster.avif?t=1771532003\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic